name: No GPG signing on commits
description: Use -c commit.gpgsign=false on all git commits in this repo; user fixes signing manually before merging
type: feedback
originSessionId: 397bcd29-8d87-4ec8-9074-1ec693b16ff1
---
Always pass `-c commit.gpgsign=false` to git commit in the agentix repo.

**Why:** The Claude Code environment doesn't have access to the user's GPG key. The user will fix signing manually before merging PRs.

**How to apply:** Every `git commit` call should use `git -c commit.gpgsign=false commit ...`. This applies to all commits in this session, not just one-offs.

